      "v": 3,
      "zh": "看那坐着的，好像碧玉和红宝石；又有虹围着宝座，好像绿宝石。",
      "en": "And the one seated on it was like jasper[NOTE:1] and carnelian[NOTE:2] in appearance, and a rainbow looking like it was made of emerald[NOTE:3] encircled the throne.",
      "notes": [
        "Grk “jasper stone.”sn Jasper was a semiprecious gemstone, probably green in color (L&N 2.30).",
