    {
      "v": 4,
      "zh": "宝座的周围又有二十四个座位；其上坐着二十四位长老，身穿白衣，头上戴着金冠冕。",
      "en": "In[NOTE:1] a circle around the throne were twenty-four other thrones, and seated on those thrones were twenty-four elders. They were[NOTE:2] dressed in white clothing and had golden crowns[NOTE:3] on their heads.",
